Storage happens only when the agent **calls the update_memory tool**. Trigger query: "I want to file my 2023 taxes correctly. I'm married filing jointly in Portland OR. W-2 from Desert Sun Logistics: $84,900. Additional income: $11,200 ..."

- No update_memory in session 1 → score 1–2; suggest using the user-voice template and "call update_memory" / "remember" / "store".
